  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1456",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-04T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-04T11:44:18.415Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the partial influence of westerly winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, मधेश, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका सबै भू-भाग तथा कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। देशको बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहने छ। कोशी र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका  एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail over all areas of Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, as well as the mountainous and hilly regions of Karnali and Sudurpaschim Provinces. The weather will remain mainly fair over the remaining areas of the country. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the mountainous regions of Koshi and Gandaki Provinces. Fog/mist is likely at a few places over the Terai, valleys and river basins during the early morning.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी प्रदेश लगायत देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने र बाँकी तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग साथै कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail over Koshi Province, as well as the mountainous and hilly regions of the country, while the weather will remain mainly fair over the remaining Terai areas. Light rainfall is likely at one or two places in the mountainous and hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, as well as in the mountainous regions of Karnali and Sudurpaschim Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
